# Whitelist build context: ONLY what deploy/Dockerfile copies may enter.
# This guarantees cow-level herd data (data/event_files, data/
# intermediate_files) and rendered reports never reach a Docker image.
*
!ParnellBenchmark/
!functions/fxn_parnell_cr.R
!functions/fxn_parnell_eligibility.R
!functions/fxn_own_herd_measures.R
!data/parnell_files/benchmark_data_v2.rds
!data/parnell_files/own_data.rds
!deploy/
